{"message":"I can help you dispute the Costco and Amazon credit-card charges. Because you mentioned fraud, we’ll address those charges promptly and separately identify any duplicates, incorrect amounts, missing goods/services, or refund issues.

To begin, please provide your full name. For identity verification, also provide any two of the following: date of birth, registered email address, phone number, or home address. Please do not send your full card number or security code.

For each charge, please include the merchant, amount, purchase date, and what went wrong. Also tell me whether you contacted the merchant, whether you want a full refund, partial refund, or reversal, and whether you want the card cancelled and replaced or kept active."}

