{"message":"I can’t use the address on file without your confirmation, because replacement cards require a confirmed mailing address, including any apartment or suite number. The verified address currently on file is 4532 Magnolia Lane, Philadelphia, PA 19103.

Please review your contact or profile information in the Rho-Bank app or website, then reply with the exact mailing address you want used. If you cannot access those services, call 1-800-RHO-BANK for assistance confirming or updating the address.

